		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5109&amp;p=37028#p37028"><![CDATA[
<blockquote class="uncited"><div>It should be noted that although the MD9600 does have separate IF's for VHF and UHF, it only has 1 FM demodulator  becasue the DMR / DSP chip is used to demodulate FM.<br><br>So I doubt it would be possible to demodulate signals from both bands at the same time, even if you changed the firmware to enable both the VHF and UHF Rx chains at the same time.<br><br>The firmware souce code is however available, so you could download, modifiy and recompile it, to conduct your own experiments in this area.</div></blockquote>OK, thank you very much!<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6826">BA7IQE</a> — Thu May 08, 2025 6:36 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
